@startuml UC-34-GuiThongBao
!pragma layout smetana

title UC-34: Gửi thông báo

actor        "Admin"                                       as Admin
boundary     "NotificationPage\n(React)"                   as NotifPage
control      "NotificationController\n(REST)"              as NotifController
control      "NotificationService"                         as NotifService
entity       "NotificationRepository"                      as NotifRepo
entity       "UserRepository"                              as UserRepo
database     "MySQL"                                        as DB
collections  "EmailService\n(Bên thứ ba)"                   as EmailService

== Main Success Scenario ==

Admin -> NotifPage: 1. Chọn "Gửi thông báo"
NotifPage -> NotifPage: 2. Hiển thị form\n(tiêu đề, nội dung,\nđối tượng nhận)
Admin -> NotifPage: 3. Nhập tiêu đề & nội dung
Admin -> NotifPage: 4. Chọn đối tượng\n(Tất cả HV/GV/1 lớp/cá nhân)
Admin -> NotifPage: 5. Click "Gửi"
NotifPage -> NotifController: 6. POST /api/notifications\n{title, content, recipients}
activate NotifController

NotifController -> NotifService: 7. sendNotification(data)
activate NotifService

NotifService -> NotifService: 8. Validate title not empty
NotifService -> NotifService: 9. Validate content not empty
NotifService -> NotifService: 10. Validate recipient list

alt 11. Dữ liệu hợp lệ
  NotifService -> NotifRepo: 12. save(notification)
  activate NotifRepo
  NotifRepo -> DB: 13. INSERT INTO notifications\n(title, content, created_by,\ncreated_at)
  activate DB
  DB --> NotifRepo: 14. Notification entity
  deactivate DB
  NotifRepo --> NotifService: 15. savedNotification
  deactivate NotifRepo

  NotifService -> UserRepo: 16. findRecipients(recipientSpec)
  activate UserRepo
  UserRepo -> DB: 17. SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE role IN (...) OR class_id = ?
  activate DB
  DB --> UserRepo: 18. List<User>
  deactivate DB
  UserRepo --> NotifService: 19. recipientList
  deactivate UserRepo

  NotifService -> NotifRepo: 20. saveAll(notificationRecipients)
  activate NotifRepo
  NotifRepo -> DB: 21. INSERT INTO notification_recipients\n(notification_id, user_id, status)
  activate DB
  DB --> NotifRepo: 22. success
  deactivate DB
  NotifRepo --> NotifService: 23. done
  deactivate NotifRepo

  NotifService -> EmailService: 24. sendEmail(recipients, title, content)
  activate EmailService
  EmailService -> EmailService: 25. Gửi email SMTP
  alt 26. Email thành công
    EmailService --> NotifService: 27. success
    deactivate EmailService
  else 26a. Email thất bại
    EmailService --> NotifService: 28. Exception
    deactivate EmailService
    NotifService -> NotifService: 29. Ghi log lỗi email\n(không ảnh hưởng chính)
  end

  NotifService -> NotifService: 30. Ghi Audit Log
  NotifService --> NotifController: 31. SuccessDTO\n{emailStatus}
  deactivate NotifService
  NotifController --> NotifPage: 32. 201 Created\n"Gửi thông báo thành công"
  deactivate NotifController
  NotifPage --> Admin: 33. Thông báo thành công\n(kèm trạng thái email)

else 11a. Dữ liệu không hợp lệ
  alt 11a1. Tiêu đề trống
    NotifService --> NotifController: 34. Throw EmptyTitleException
  else 11a2. Nội dung trống
    NotifService --> NotifController: 35. Throw EmptyContentException
  else 11a3. Đối tượng không hợp lệ
    NotifService --> NotifController: 36. Throw InvalidRecipientException
  end
  deactivate NotifService
  NotifController --> NotifPage: 37. 400 Bad Request\n{error message}
  deactivate NotifController
  NotifPage --> Admin: 38. Hiển thị thông báo lỗi
end

== Critical Exception: DB Error ==

Admin -> NotifPage: 39. Nhập thông báo và gửi
NotifPage -> NotifController: 40. POST /api/notifications
activate NotifController
NotifController -> NotifService: 41. sendNotification(data)
activate NotifService
NotifService -> NotifRepo: 42. save(notification)
activate NotifRepo
NotifRepo -> DB: 43. INSERT ...
activate DB
DB --> NotifRepo: 44. SQL Exception
deactivate DB
NotifRepo --> NotifService: 45. Throw DataAccessException
deactivate NotifRepo
NotifService --> NotifController: 46. Throw SystemErrorException
deactivate NotifService
NotifController --> NotifPage: 47. 500 Internal Server Error
deactivate NotifController
NotifPage --> Admin: 48. "Hệ thống có lỗi,\nvui lòng thử lại"

== Critical Exception: Email Service Unreachable ==

Admin -> NotifPage: 49. Gửi thông báo
NotifPage -> NotifController: 50. POST /api/notifications
activate NotifController
NotifController -> NotifService: 51. sendNotification(data)
activate NotifService
NotifService -> NotifRepo: 52. save + saveAll (thành công)
activate NotifRepo
NotifRepo -> DB: 53. INSERT (notification + recipients)
activate DB
DB --> NotifRepo: 54. success
deactivate DB
NotifRepo --> NotifService: 55. done
deactivate NotifRepo
NotifService -> EmailService: 56. sendEmail(recipients, title, content)
activate EmailService
EmailService --> NotifService: 57. Connection timeout
deactivate EmailService
NotifService -> NotifService: 58. Ghi log lỗi email
NotifService --> NotifController: 59. SuccessDTO\n{emailStatus: "failed"}
deactivate NotifService
NotifController --> NotifPage: 60. 201 Created\n"Gửi thành công.\nEmail gặp sự cố cho một số người nhận."
deactivate NotifController
NotifPage --> Admin: 61. Thông báo\n(in-app OK, email failed)

@enduml
